WEBVTT

00:04:59.220 --> 00:05:02.542
trying not to knock over
or terrify tour groups,

00:05:02.566 --> 00:05:04.145
when we realize we're not alone,

00:05:04.169 --> 00:05:06.457
there's another team
on the runaround as well,

00:05:06.481 --> 00:05:08.518
and we don't know who's ahead.

00:05:08.542 --> 00:05:11.204
So, we're a mess of anxiety,

00:05:11.228 --> 00:05:14.307
anticipation, exhilaration
and sleep deprivation,

00:05:14.331 --> 00:05:16.585
when we arrive at the Alchemist,

00:05:16.609 --> 00:05:18.903
a sculpture in which we find ...

00:05:19.910 --> 00:05:21.178
this coin.

00:05:21.202 --> 00:05:22.357
(Cheers)

00:05:22.381 --> 00:05:23.533
Yeah.

00:05:23.557 --> 00:05:25.661
(Applause)

00:05:25.685 --> 00:05:28.107
And in claiming it,
we win the MIT Mystery Hunt

00:05:28.131 --> 00:05:30.622
by a tiny margin of five minutes.